    "description": "JAG-19 (Just Another Glock) Frame: Laffs\n\n\"Just Another Glock\" frame. For those that just need a basic frame. Not meant to stand out, simple as it comes.\n\nPart of the JAG Pistol Frame line, utilizes Glock 19 length compatible slides; utilizes Glock 19 sized magazines.\n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C\nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Perimeters: 8+ \nInfill: 90%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 18%\n\n\n\nParts list and assembly instructions are identical with the DD19.2, and can be found here:\n\nOdysee: https://odysee.com/@TheGatalog-PrintableFramesReceivers:9/The-FMDA-DD19.2-3D-Printable-Glock-Frame:0\n\n\n\nThe original JAG-17 full sized frame can be found here:\n\nOdysee: https://odysee.com/@LFRF:d/JAG17GlkFrm:0\n\n\n\nRails for this frame can be found here: \n\nAves: https://www.avesrails.com/FMDA-DD192-Rail-Kit-_p_29.html\n\n\n\nAccreditations:\n\nDeterrence Dispensed: Creators of the DD19.2. Used the internals of the DD19.2 frame for the foundation of this design.",
